@@ -0,0 +1,145 @@
+/*!
+ * \file   mfront/src/GenericParallel/MaterialProperty/ArcaneBackend.cxx
+ * \brief  This file implements the arcane backend of the `generic-parallel`
+ * material property interface
+ * \date   23/10/2026
